    ["　　6月29日，梅森工厂女工娜塔报案，妹妹温妮突然失踪，因失踪时间未超过48小时，暂未开始调查。"] = "　　June 29th, Mason Factory worker Nata reported that her younger sister Winnie had suddenly gone missing. As the disappearance time has not exceeded 48 hours, an investigation has not yet begun.",
    ["　　塔罗学派必读榜前五的优秀作品，贝尔纳黛会长倾心推荐！\n　　《观众的自我修养》据说是一位半神级观众领域的导师指导编纂的。\n　　《赞美太阳》“赞美太阳”不应流于表面，而该发自内心。\n　　《海上八万里》一本讲述海上生活的小说，书籍粉丝常因为作者是真水手还是假水手争论不休。\n　　《秘密的秘密》一本加入了神秘学元素的侦探小说，其开放式结局引发了巨大的争议。\n　　《学会看书》白塔途径学员的必修书目，同时是塔罗学派最热门的通识书籍。"] = "　　Top five excellent works on the Tarot Club's must-read list, highly recommended by President Bernadette! \n　　\"Self-Cultivation of a Spectator\" is said to have been compiled under the guidance of a demigod-level mentor in the Spectator pathway. \n　　\"Praise the Sun\": \"Praise the Sun\" should not be superficial, but come from the heart. \n　　\"Eighty Thousand Miles at Sea\": A novel about life at sea, where book fans often argue about whether the author is a real sailor or a fake one. \n　　\"Secret of Secrets\": A detective novel with occult elements, its open ending has sparked huge controversy. \n　　\"Learning to Read\": A required book for students of the White Tower pathway, and also the most popular general knowledge book in the Tarot Club.",
